close_reason: Coverage gate landed and locally verified; the Node 22 CI leg is unobserved until the pull request runs.
body: "Baseline measured 2026-07-29 across seven source files: 89.83 line, 79.24 branch, 90.71 function. Weakest file is src/extension.ts at 61.83 line, 38.98 branch, 47.37 function; src/cli.ts branch coverage is 59.56. Thresholds are pinned at the measured floor so the number can only move up."
